    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25186" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jam-jam</span></b>  (or separat. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jam jam</span></b> ), the strengthened jam, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>already, now</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">o jamjam, optume, praeceptis paruisti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Most. 2, 1, 72</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jamjam faciam ut jusseris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Curc. 5, 3, 29</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jamjam intellego, Crasse, quid dicas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. de
					Or. 3, 24</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Brut. 14, 55</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Phil.
				2, 34, 87</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jamjam nulla mora est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 2, 701</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jamjam casurae arces,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 12, 588</span></i>
			; v. jam, I. A. 1. b. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>.</div>
